---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const cdn = "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@picocss/pico@2/css/pico.min.css";
const npmCmd = "npm install @picocss/pico";
---

<Base
  title="Pico CSS · 面向语义化 HTML 的极简 CSS 框架"
  desc="极简、轻量的起步套件，以语义化语法为先，让每个 HTML 元素默认就具备响应式与优雅的样式。"
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="container home">
    <!-- 1 · Hero：左文案 / 右真实组件预览 -->
    <section class="home-hero" aria-label="介绍">
      <div class="home-hero-copy">
        <p class="home-kicker"><span class="home-kicker-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>v2.1.1 · 语义化 CSS 框架 · 中文文档</p>
        <h1>写 HTML，<br />就够了。</h1>
        <p class="home-lead">
          Pico 为原生标签提供开箱即用的响应式样式与明暗模式。零依赖，一行 CSS 即可起步。
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row home-cta">
          <a href={`${base}docs/`} role="button">阅读文档</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/picocss/pico" role="button" class="secondary outline" rel="noopener external" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="home-meta">
          <li><strong>约 15 KB</strong><span>gzip 轻量</span></li>
          <li><strong>零依赖</strong><span>无 JS 运行时</span></li>
          <li><strong>双模式</strong><span>浅色 / 深色</span></li>
          <li><strong>MIT</strong><span>开放许可</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <figure class="browser" aria-label="Pico 实时组件预览">
        <figcaption class="browser-bar">
          <span class="browser-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span class="browser-url">picocss.ndjp.net/docs/</span>
          <span class="browser-live"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>实时渲染</span>
        </figcaption>
        <div class="browser-body">
          <hgroup>
            <h3>Hello world!</h3>
            <p>语义即样式：标题、链接、表单开箱可用。</p>
          </hgroup>
          <form role="search" onsubmit="return false">
            <fieldset role="group">
              <input type="search" name="q" placeholder="搜索文档…" aria-label="搜索文档" />
              <input type="submit" value="搜索" />
            </fieldset>
          </form>
          <div class="browser-row">
            <button class="small">主要按钮</button>
            <button class="small secondary">次要</button>
            <button class="small contrast outline">对比</button>
          </div>
          <div class="browser-grid" aria-hidden="true">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
          </div>
          <progress value="68" max="100">68%</progress>
          <blockquote>“它像加强版的 reset：先有好默认，再做精定制。”<footer><cite>— 本站译者注</cite></footer></blockquote>
        </div>
        <span class="browser-chip chip-a">classless 可用</span>
        <span class="browser-chip chip-b">20 套预编译主题</span>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <!-- 2 · 安装条：单一窗口 + 内联分支 -->
    <section class="home-install" aria-label="安装">
      <div class="home-window" data-reveal>
        <div class="home-window-bar">
          <span class="browser-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span>一行引入，即刻起步</span>
          <button type="button" class="home-copy" data-copy={cdn} aria-label="复制 CDN 链接">复制</button>
        </div>
        <pre class="home-code"><code><span class="tk-p">&lt;link</span> <span class="tk-a">rel</span>=<span class="tk-s">"stylesheet"</span> <span class="tk-a">href</span>=<span class="tk-s">"{cdn}"</span><span class="tk-p">&gt;</span></code></pre>
        <div class="home-install-foot">
          <button type="button" class="home-npm" data-copy={npmCmd} aria-label="复制 NPM 命令"><code>{npmCmd}</code><span>复制</span></button>
          <span class="home-install-links">
            <a href={`${base}docs/`}>手动安装</a> ·
            <a href={`${base}docs/sass/`}>Sass 定制</a> ·
            <a href={`${base}docs/version-picker/`}>版本选择器</a>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3 · 为什么是 Pico：非对称 bento，4 格对 4 点 -->
    <section class="home-why" aria-label="核心特性">
      <h2>恰到好处的一切</h2>
      <p class="home-sub">Pico 是「加强版 HTML 重置」，也是干净设计系统的起点：先给好默认，再留足定制空间。</p>
      <div class="home-bento">
        <article class="bento bento-wide" data-reveal>
          <h3>20 套配色，开箱即换</h3>
          <p>预编译调色板走 CDN 引入，Indigo 为默认，组合超过 100 种。</p>
          <div class="bento-swatches" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="pico-background-red-500"></span><span class="pico-background-pink-500"></span><span class="pico-background-fuchsia-500"></span><span class="pico-background-purple-500"></span><span class="pico-background-violet-500"></span><span class="pico-background-indigo-500"></span><span class="pico-background-blue-500"></span><span class="pico-background-azure-500"></span><span class="pico-background-cyan-500"></span><span class="pico-background-jade-500"></span><span class="pico-background-green-500"></span><span class="pico-background-lime-500"></span><span class="pico-background-yellow-500"></span><span class="pico-background-amber-500"></span><span class="pico-background-pumpkin-500"></span><span class="pico-background-orange-500"></span>
          </div>
          <a href={`${base}docs/colors/`}>查看颜色 →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="bento" data-reveal>
          <h3>明暗模式跟手</h3>
          <p>跟随系统偏好，顶栏可手动钉住选择，首帧写入防闪烁。</p>
          <div class="bento-theme" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lt">浅</span><span class="dk">深</span></div>
          <a href={`${base}docs/color-schemes/`}>配色方案 →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="bento" data-reveal>
          <h3>容器与栅格</h3>
          <p>居中容器、流式区块与 12 列栅格，各断点自动适配。</p>
          <div class="bento-cols" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <a href={`${base}docs/grid/`}>栅格文档 →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="bento bento-wide" data-reveal>
          <h3>语义排版，自带层级</h3>
          <p>标题、引用、表格、代码无需类名，行高与中文回退已调好。</p>
          <p class="bento-type" aria-hidden="true">Aa 标题 / 正文 / <code>code</code> / <kbd>⌘ K</kbd></p>
          <a href={`${base}docs/typography/`}>排版文档 →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4 · 12 行起步：代码与预览左右对照 -->
    <section class="home-start" aria-label="起步示例">
      <h2>12 行起步</h2>
      <p class="home-sub">把 <code>pico.min.css</code> 挂进 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code>，剩下的交给语义标签。</p>
      <div class="home-editor" data-reveal>
        <div class="home-editor-code">
          <div class="home-window-bar">
            <span>index.html</span>
            <button type="button" class="home-copy" data-copy={`<!doctype html>\n<html lang="zh">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset="utf-8">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">\n    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">\n    <link rel="stylesheet" href="${cdn}">\n    <title>Hello world!</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main class="container">\n      <h1>Hello world!</h1>\n    </main>\n  </body>\n</html>`} aria-label="复制起步模板">复制模板</button>
          </div>
<pre><code><span class="tk-p">&lt;!doctype html&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-p">&lt;html</span> <span class="tk-a">lang</span>=<span class="tk-s">"zh"</span><span class="tk-p">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-p">&lt;head&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-p">&lt;meta</span> <span class="tk-a">charset</span>=<span class="tk-s">"utf-8"</span><span class="tk-p">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-p">&lt;meta</span> <span class="tk-a">name</span>=<span class="tk-s">"viewport"</span> <span class="tk-a">content</span>=<span class="tk-s">"width=device-width, initial-scale=1"</span><span class="tk-p">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-p">&lt;meta</span> <span class="tk-a">name</span>=<span class="tk-s">"color-scheme"</span> <span class="tk-a">content</span>=<span class="tk-s">"light dark"</span><span class="tk-p">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-p">&lt;link</span> <span class="tk-a">rel</span>=<span class="tk-s">"stylesheet"</span> <span class="tk-a">href</span>=<span class="tk-s">"…/pico.min.css"</span><span class="tk-p">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-p">&lt;title&gt;</span>Hello world!<span class="tk-p">&lt;/title&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-p">&lt;/head&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-p">&lt;body&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-p">&lt;main</span> <span class="tk-a">class</span>=<span class="tk-s">"container"</span><span class="tk-p">&gt;</span>…<span class="tk-p">&lt;/main&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-p">&lt;/body&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-p">&lt;/html&gt;</span></code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="home-editor-demo">
          <p class="demo-label">实时效果</p>
          <div style="padding:0;max-width:none">
            <hgroup><h3>Hello world!</h3><p>语义即样式</p></hgroup>
            <p>这是一段普通的 <a href={`${base}docs/`}>HTML</a>。表单、表格、卡片开箱可用。</p>
            <form role="search" onsubmit="return false">
              <fieldset role="group">
                <input type="search" placeholder="搜索…" aria-label="搜索" />
                <input type="submit" value="搜索" />
              </fieldset>
            </form>
          </div>
          <a href={`${base}docs/forms/`}>表单文档 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5 · 文档地图：分组直达 -->
    <section class="home-map" aria-label="文档地图">
      <h2>按需直达文档</h2>
      <p class="home-sub">39 页中文文档，与官方 URL 一一对应，锚点保留英文 slug。</p>
      <div class="home-docgrid">
        <div data-reveal><h3>入门</h3><ul><li><a href={`${base}docs/`}>快速开始</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/classless/`}>无类版本</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/conditional/`}>条件样式</a></li></ul></div>
        <div data-reveal><h3>定制</h3><ul><li><a href={`${base}docs/css-variables/`}>CSS 变量</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/sass/`}>Sass</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/colors/`}>颜色</a></li></ul></div>
        <div data-reveal><h3>布局</h3><ul><li><a href={`${base}docs/container/`}>容器</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/grid/`}>栅格</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/overflow-auto/`}>溢出自动</a></li></ul></div>
        <div data-reveal><h3>内容</h3><ul><li><a href={`${base}docs/typography/`}>排版</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/button/`}>按钮</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/table/`}>表格</a></li></ul></div>
        <div data-reveal><h3>表单</h3><ul><li><a href={`${base}docs/forms/`}>概览</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/forms/input/`}>输入框</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/forms/select/`}>下拉选择</a></li></ul></div>
        <div data-reveal><h3>组件</h3><ul><li><a href={`${base}docs/modal/`}>模态框</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/card/`}>卡片</a></li><li><a href={`${base}docs/nav/`}>导航</a></li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6 · 收尾：单一意图 -->
    <section class="home-final" data-reveal aria-label="开始">
      <h2>从第一行语义标签开始</h2>
      <p>中文翻译遵循 MIT 许可，与上游文档结构保持同步。</p>
      <p><a href={`${base}docs/`} role="button">阅读文档</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <nav class="container">
      <ul>
        <li><a class="secondary" href={`${base}docs/`}>文档</a></li>
        <li><a class="secondary" href="https://github.com/picocss/pico" rel="noopener external" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a class="secondary" href="https://picocss.com" rel="noopener external" target="_blank">官网</a></li>
      </ul>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <small>
            中文翻译自 <a href="https://picocss.com" rel="noopener external">picocss.com</a>，
            遵循 <a href="https://github.com/picocss/pico/blob/master/LICENSE.md" rel="noopener external">MIT 许可证</a>。
          </small>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </footer>
</Base>

<script>
  const root = document.documentElement;
  root.classList.add("js");
  // 复制按钮
  document.querySelectorAll("[data-copy]").forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      const el = btn as HTMLElement;
      const text = el.getAttribute("data-copy") || "";
      const label = el.textContent;
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
      } catch {
        const ta = document.createElement("textarea");
        ta.value = text;
        document.body.appendChild(ta);
        ta.select();
        document.execCommand("copy");
        ta.remove();
      }
      el.textContent = "已复制 ✓";
      el.setAttribute("data-done", "true");
      window.setTimeout(() => {
        el.textContent = label;
        el.removeAttribute("data-done");
      }, 1400);
    });
  });
  // 滚动显现（无 JS 时默认可见）
  const items = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("[data-reveal]"));
  if ("IntersectionObserver" in window && !window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches) {
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => entries.forEach((e) => {
        if (e.isIntersecting) {
          (e.target as HTMLElement).classList.add("is-in");
          io.unobserve(e.target);
        }
      }),
      { threshold: 0.12 }
    );
    items.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));
  } else {
    items.forEach((el) => (el as HTMLElement).classList.add("is-in"));
  }
</script>

<style>
  .home { --home-ring: var(--pico-muted-border-color); }
  .home-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 3.5rem 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .home-hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -1rem -2rem auto;
    height: 340px;
    z-index: -1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--home-ring) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 100% 32px,
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--home-ring) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 32px 100%;
    opacity: 0.35;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(70% 90% at 30% 20%, black 30%, transparent 75%);
  }
  .home-kicker {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--pico-muted-color);
    border: 1px solid var(--home-ring);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.8rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pico-card-background-color) 70%, transparent);
  }
  .home-kicker-dot { width: 0.5rem; height: 0.5rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pico-primary); }
  .home-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.6vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  .home-lead { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--pico-color-grey-600); max-width: 44ch; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
  html[data-theme="dark"] .home-lead { color: var(--pico-color-grey-400); }
  .home-cta { margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .home-meta { list-style: none; padding: 1rem 0 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ring); }
  .home-meta li { display: grid; gap: 0.1rem; }
  .home-meta strong { font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .home-meta span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--pico-muted-color); }
  /* 浏览器预览 */
  .browser {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--home-ring);
    border-radius: calc(var(--pico-border-radius) + 6px);
    background: var(--pico-card-background-color);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -30px color-mix(in srgb, var(--pico-primary) 30%, transparent);
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .browser-bar, .home-window-bar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-ring);
    font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--pico-muted-color);
  }
  .browser-dots { display: inline-flex; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .browser-dots i { width: 0.65rem; height: 0.65rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pico-muted-border-color); display: block; }
  .browser-dots i:first-child { background: #e5484d; } .browser-dots i:nth-child(2) { background: #f5a524; } .browser-dots i:nth-child(3) { background: #30a46c; }
  .browser-url {
    flex: 1; text-align: center; font-size: 0.78rem;
    background: var(--pico-background-color);
    border: 1px solid var(--home-ring); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;
    overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .browser-live { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pico-primary); white-space: nowrap; }
  .browser-live i { width: 0.45rem; height: 0.45rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #30a46c; }
  .browser-body { padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.4rem; display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; }
  .browser-body hgroup { margin: 0; } .browser-body hgroup h3 { margin-bottom: 0.2rem; } .browser-body hgroup p { margin: 0; color: var(--pico-muted-color); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .browser-body blockquote { margin: 0; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .browser-body progress { margin: 0; }
  .browser-row { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .browser-row button.small { padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem; font-size: 0.82rem; margin: 0; }
  .browser-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .browser-grid span { height: 2.2rem; border-radius: var(--pico-border-radius); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pico-primary) 14%, var(--pico-card-background-color)); border: 1px solid var(--home-ring); }
  .browser-chip {
    position: absolute; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--pico-card-background-color);
    border: 1px solid var(--home-ring); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  }
  .chip-a { top: -0.85rem; left: 1.2rem; } .chip-b { bottom: -0.9rem; right: 1.4rem; }
  /* 安装窗口 */
  .home-install { padding-block: 1rem; }
  .home-window { border: 1px solid var(--home-ring); border-radius: var(--pico-border-radius); background: var(--pico-card-background-color); overflow: hidden; }
  .home-window-bar { justify-content: space-between; }
  .home-copy { margin: 0; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; font-size: 0.78rem; border: 1px solid var(--home-ring); border-radius: 999px; background: transparent; color: var(--pico-primary); font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  .home-copy[data-done="true"] { color: #30a46c; border-color: #30a46c; }
  .home-code { margin: 0; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 0.86rem; }
  .tk-p { color: var(--pico-muted-color); } .tk-a { color: var(--pico-primary); } .tk-s { color: #177245; }
  html[data-theme="dark"] .tk-s { color: #7ddf9a; }
  .home-install-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 0.7rem 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ring); }
  .home-npm { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; background: none; border: 1px dashed var(--home-ring); border-radius: var(--pico-border-radius); padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem; cursor: pointer; color: inherit; font-size: 0.84rem; }
  .home-npm span { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--pico-primary); font-weight: 600; }
  .home-install-links { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--pico-muted-color); }
  /* 通用节标题：纵向堆叠，不用左右分栏 */
  .home-why, .home-start, .home-map { padding-block: 2.8rem 0.5rem; }
  .home-why h2, .home-start h2, .home-map h2, .home-final h2 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2rem); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .home-sub { color: var(--pico-color-grey-600); max-width: 62ch; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
